### 问卷系统接口测试（IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client 或 VS Code REST Client 可直接运行）
### 基础地址：http://localhost:8081

### 1. 注册（首次运行先执行；用户名已存在会返回 409，换一个或直接登录）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lee",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

### 2. 登录（把返回的 token 填到下面的 @token）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lee",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token); %}

### 3. 创建问卷（携带 Token，草稿含 4 种题型与跳转规则）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "编程课程满意度调查",
  "description": "匿名问卷示例",
  "anonymous": true,
  "allowMultiple": false,
  "questions": [
    {
      "type": "single",
      "title": "你是否完成过至少一个编程项目？",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        { "label": "是" },
        { "label": "否" }
      ],
      "jumps": [
        { "op": "eq", "optionId": "OPT_NO_PLACEHOLDER", "targetQuestionId": "END" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "multiple",
      "title": "你使用过哪些语言？（可多选）",
      "required": true,
      "constraints": { "minSelect": 1, "maxSelect": 4 },
      "options": [
        { "label": "Java" },
        { "label": "Python" },
        { "label": "JavaScript" },
        { "label": "C/C++" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "title": "你平均每周编程多少小时？",
      "required": false,
      "constraints": { "minValue": 0, "maxValue": 100, "isInteger": true }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "你想对课程说的话",
      "required": false,
      "constraints": { "maxLength": 200 }
    }
  ]
}

### 4. 我的问卷列表
GET http://localhost:8081/api/surveys/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 发布问卷（把 {surveyId} 换成第 3 步返回的 id；发布后 data.publicId 用于答题）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/surveys/{surveyId}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 开始答卷（把 {publicId} 换成发布返回的 publicId）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/surveys/{publicId}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 提交单题答案（把 {responseId} 换成第 6 步返回的 responseId；answer 按当前题目类型给值）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/responses/{responseId}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": "REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_QUESTION_ID",
  "answer": "REPLACE_WITH_OPTION_ID_OR_VALUE"
}

### 8. 最终交卷
POST http://localhost:8081/api/responses/{responseId}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 整卷统计
GET http://localhost:8081/api/surveys/{surveyId}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 未带 Token 访问受保护接口（预期 401，用于验证拦截器）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/surveys/mine
